I"�<p>Generate trace file to identify performance issues:</p>

<p>Set an identifier to the session:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">ALTER SESSION SET TRACEFILE_IDENTIFIER='&lt;SOMETHING&gt;';</code></p>

<p>Enable trace to the current session:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">ALTER SESSION SET SQL_TRACE = TRUE;</code></p>

<p>Improve the file readability</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">TKPROF &lt;src_file.trc&gt;  &lt;output_file.txt&gt;</code></p>

<p>Disable trace to the current session:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">ALTER SESSION SET SQL_TRACE = FALSE;</code></p>

<p>Enable trace to another user session:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">EXEC SYS.DBMS_SYSTEM.SET_SQL_TRACE_IN_SESSION( &lt;O_SID&gt; ,  &lt;O_SERIAL#&gt; ,TRUE);</code></p>

<p>Disable trace to another user session:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">EXEC SYS.DBMS_SYSTEM.SET_SQL_TRACE_IN_SESSION( &lt;O_SID&gt; ,  &lt;O_SERIAL#&gt; ,FALSE);</code></p>

<p>Disable trace to another user session with more details:</p>

<p><code class="highlighter-rouge">EXEC SYS.DBMS_SYSTEM.SET_EV( &lt;SID&gt;, &lt;SERIAL#&gt;,10046,12, '');</code></p>

<p>Find the trace file:</p>

<div class="highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>SELECT a.sid,  
    a.serial#,  
    a.username,  
    a.osuser,  
    b.spid,  
    b.TRACEFILE  
FROM v$session a,  
    gv$process b  
WHERE 
    a.paddr  = b.addr  
    AND a.username = '&lt;USERNAME&gt;'  
ORDER BY a.sid;  
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Trigger to activate trace for a given username</p>

<div class="highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER USER_TRACE_TRG
AFTER LOGON ON DATABASE
BEGIN
    IF USER = '&lt;USERNAME&gt;'
  THEN
    execute immediate 'ALTER SESSION SET TRACEFILE_IDENTIFIER =''SQL_TRACE_''';
    execute immediate 'ALTER SESSION SET SQL_TRACE=TRUE';
    execute immediate 'alter session set events ''10046 trace name context forever,level 12''';
    execute immediate 'alter session set statistics_level=all';
    execute immediate 'alter session set max_dump_file_size = unlimited';
  END IF;
EXCEPTION
WHEN OTHERS THEN
NULL;
END;
/
</code></pre></div></div>
